# Intrepid Paleontologist: "You may cast Dinosaur creature spells from among cards you own exiled with this creature."
# Bot1's Paleontologist exiles two cards with {2} each, with mana still left over for a cast afterwards, so a refusal is the permission's
# and not the mana's: their own Grizzly Bears (a creature, not a Dinosaur, CR 205.3m) and Bot2's Nest Robber (a Dinosaur creature, but a
# card Bot1 does not own, CR 108.3, which Lightning Bolt put in Bot2's graveyard). Neither can be cast from exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Intrepid Paleontologist
Grizzly Bears
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Nest Robber
Island x17

